e 500-square-foot patio with lawn awaits with breathtaking views and moments of outdoor bliss.   *****The property is available fully furnished, with a minimum rental term of six months and then month to month. (id:67604)"},"30378903":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270106708000000/reb89/highres/3/R3173663_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270106708000000/reb89/highres/3/R3173663_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270106708000000/reb89/highres/3/R3173663_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270106708000000/reb89/highres/3/R3173663_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270106708000000/reb89/highres/3/R3173663_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270106708000000/reb89/highres/3/R3173663_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270106708000000/reb89/highres/3/R3173663_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270106708000000/reb89/highres/3/R3173663_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270106708000000/reb89/highres/3/R3173663_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270106708000000/reb89/highres/3/R3173663_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270106708000000/reb89/highres/3/R3173663_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270106708000000/reb89/highres/3/R3173663_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270106708000000/reb89/highres/3/R3173663_13.jpg"],"remarks":"RESORT-STYLE LIVING o Enjoy membership to the exclusive Sophora Club, featuring 5,000 square feet of indoor facilities paired with 13,000 square feet of outdoor amenities o Stay in shape with an air-conditioned fitness studio and yoga loft; host a gathering in the lounge with a wet bar or in the family-friendly games library o A  arge covered outdoor area with patio furniture, in addition to a barbecue and dining area adjacent to a water feature. (id:67604)"},"30446679":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639286487169000000/reb89/highres/2/R3178732_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.real